; Class-2 RELATIONAL recoverability: busy->idle iff data==target.
; data,target are 48-bit, both init 0, both increment by 1 => data==target INVARIANT.
; Recoverability (AG EF idle) HOLDS, but only provable with the relational predicate
; data==target: without it the wide increments UF-wrap (havoc) => busy may-loops => bottom.
1 sort bitvec 1
2 sort bitvec 48
3 state 1 ctrl
4 state 2 data
5 state 2 target
6 zero 2
7 one 2
9 one 1
10 init 1 3 9
11 init 2 4 6
12 init 2 5 6
13 add 2 4 7
14 add 2 5 7
15 eq 1 4 5
16 not 1 15
17 and 1 3 16
18 next 1 3 17
19 next 2 4 13
20 next 2 5 14
